From 143074d27ffe6c32d1bc92d4e6432cff80728027 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Storey <martinstorey@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:07:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] chatgpt tab: say tools work in work mode, not chat

ChatGPT runs MCP tools in Work mode (and the Codex workspace) but not in
ordinary Chat, where the Bristlenose chip is offered and the model says it
can't reach it. Measured for the ChatGPT plugin route on 29 Sep 2026; for
today's config-file route it is inferred, which is why this is a separate
patch from the Claude one. One key x 21 locales ("Work"/"Chat" stay English,
as ChatGPT's own labels).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
